WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.178 --> 00:00:03.399
- Ew, I hate that noise. It's so gross.

00:00:03.399 --> 00:00:05.649
(laughter)

00:00:12.663 --> 00:00:16.821
- Today we're going to be
painting each other naked.

00:00:16.821 --> 00:00:17.904
- Wait, what?

00:00:19.069 --> 00:00:21.655
- Just kidding, drunk. Even better.

00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:24.240
- I think I've known Clark as
long as I've been working here

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.798
So two years in now.

00:00:25.798 --> 00:00:28.960
I suck at painting, I am not a Picasso.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:29.951
- I need alcohol.

00:00:29.951 --> 00:00:30.966
- I think so.

00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:31.967
- I think it's time.

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:34.222
- Those are some cute-ass
wine glasses man!

00:00:34.222 --> 00:00:37.061
- Those are some big-ass wine glasses.

00:00:37.061 --> 00:00:39.293
- [Brenda] Wine please.

00:00:39.293 --> 00:00:41.126
About time, thank you.

00:00:42.186 --> 00:00:43.219
- Cheers.

00:00:43.219 --> 00:00:44.052
- Cheers.

00:00:45.283 --> 00:00:46.924
- Let's get started, bitches.

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:49.877
(classical music)

00:00:49.877 --> 00:00:51.517
- Cha cha cha.

00:00:51.517 --> 00:00:53.414
Paint paint paint, bitches.

00:00:53.414 --> 00:00:54.599
- Paint paint paint.

00:00:54.599 --> 00:00:56.309
- I feel like this canvas
looked prettier blank.

00:00:56.309 --> 00:00:58.886
- Brenda, would you let
me cut your ear off?

00:00:58.886 --> 00:01:02.117
- You know, it depends on the
amount of money you offer.

00:01:02.117 --> 00:01:05.692
- You look like Mozart or
Bach or Beethoven or someone.

00:01:05.692 --> 00:01:06.996
I'm so sorry.

00:01:06.996 --> 00:01:09.981
- It's okay. I am not offended.

00:01:09.981 --> 00:01:11.462
- You know what would be cute?

00:01:11.462 --> 00:01:12.295
- What?

00:01:12.295 --> 00:01:14.608
- Is if we took a tequila shot.

00:01:14.608 --> 00:01:16.608
- Oh my gosh, should we?

00:01:18.983 --> 00:01:19.816
- Aw man.

00:01:19.816 --> 00:01:20.956
- [Jade] That one got you?

00:01:20.956 --> 00:01:22.322
- That got me.

00:01:22.322 --> 00:01:23.155
- Tequila!

00:01:23.155 --> 00:01:25.905
- Oh my god, three, two, one, go.

00:01:28.032 --> 00:01:29.935
- That's what best friends
do, drink together.

00:01:29.935 --> 00:01:31.862
Fuck the portraits.

00:01:31.862 --> 00:01:34.970
- [Brenda] Oh, your nose
just took an epic turn.

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.387
(both laugh)

00:01:38.622 --> 00:01:40.401
- [Clark] I kinda vibe with this.

00:01:40.401 --> 00:01:44.025
- It's like, forget what
people's perception is of you.

00:01:44.025 --> 00:01:45.897
- Brenda, turn to me.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:47.480
Brenda! Turn to me.

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:52.032
- Don't let society say
what you look and feel like.

00:01:52.032 --> 00:01:53.552
- Come on.

00:01:53.552 --> 00:01:55.537
- Feed me, mommy!

00:01:55.537 --> 00:01:57.032
Shit got fucking weird.

00:01:57.032 --> 00:02:00.008
- Life is spontaneous bro,
life is just flicking paint

00:02:00.008 --> 00:02:03.570
and just doing whatever
it feels in the motions.

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:04.809
- Exactly.

00:02:04.809 --> 00:02:07.329
- [Vaughn] Whatever. I'm like
not like thrilled with it.

00:02:07.329 --> 00:02:09.547
You look a little bit like an alien.

00:02:09.547 --> 00:02:10.993
- Am I covered in paint?

00:02:10.993 --> 00:02:14.513
- Yeah you got so many splashes
in your hair and your face.

00:02:14.513 --> 00:02:16.411
- [Vaughn] Brenda, I have
something I wanna show you.

00:02:16.411 --> 00:02:17.596
- Oh god.

00:02:17.596 --> 00:02:18.651
- Okay.

00:02:18.651 --> 00:02:20.116
(Vaughn and Brenda laugh)

00:02:20.116 --> 00:02:21.793
- I haven't looked at Clark's.

00:02:21.793 --> 00:02:23.689
I'm excited to see what it is.

00:02:23.689 --> 00:02:24.928
- Should we trade?

00:02:24.928 --> 00:02:26.978
(Clark and Jade laugh)

00:02:26.978 --> 00:02:30.344
- Oh my god, first of
all, that's fucking cute.

00:02:30.344 --> 00:02:32.816
- I love that, man. That's dope!

00:02:32.816 --> 00:02:34.289
- This is awesome!

00:02:34.289 --> 00:02:37.184
(Brenda laughs)

00:02:37.184 --> 00:02:40.982
- You've definitely taken
some artistic liberties.

00:02:40.982 --> 00:02:43.886
- It's kinda fun to put your
thoughts down about your friend

00:02:43.886 --> 00:02:45.902
in a different way, oh
you're great, you're funny,

00:02:45.902 --> 00:02:48.688
you're kind, but like show that
shit through a painting, bro

00:02:48.688 --> 00:02:51.862
- Doing something for
fun was pretty special.

00:02:51.862 --> 00:02:53.878
To dedicate time to everything

00:02:53.878 --> 00:02:56.925
that makes him so awesome and cool.

00:02:56.925 --> 00:02:59.855
- Dammit, Clark, you're
making me emotional.

00:02:59.855 --> 00:03:01.290
- Where's my wine?

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:03.124
- Should I just pour wine on this?

00:03:03.124 --> 00:03:04.146
- I think so.

00:03:04.146 --> 00:03:06.202
- [Brenda] Oh my god!

00:03:06.202 --> 00:03:07.035
Oh my god!

00:03:07.933 --> 00:03:09.516
- It's crying wine!

00:03:12.231 --> 00:03:13.764
That's cool.

00:03:13.764 --> 00:03:14.615
- [Brenda] That's really cool.

00:03:14.615 --> 00:03:16.191
- Drunk...

00:03:16.191 --> 00:03:18.023
- ...Friends.

00:03:18.023 --> 00:03:18.856
Out.

00:03:19.927 --> 00:03:22.510
(upbeat music)

